# Keepsake

A RESTful API for managing Todo items, implemented in C#/.NET.

## Technical Specifications

* **Architecture:** Clean Architecture (Domain, Application, Infrastructure, and API layers)
* **Data Access:** Entity Framework Core (PostgreSQL)
* **API Interface:** Minimal APIs with OpenAPI and Scalar integration
* **Core Entities:** TodoItem

## Endpoints

* `POST /api/todos`: Create a new Todo item
* `GET /api/todos/{id}`: Retrieve a Todo item by ID
* `PUT /api/todos/{id}`: Update a Todo item's title or completion status
* `DELETE /api/todos/{id}`: Delete a Todo item
